291
00:19:36,505 --> 00:19:39,585
How dare you come all the way
to the Faculty of Fine Arts?

292
00:19:41,625 --> 00:19:43,185
It's okay, Rin.

293
00:19:43,785 --> 00:19:46,305
We'll help you.

294
00:19:46,385 --> 00:19:48,985
Don't let him beat you, Rin.
What's so great about him?

295
00:19:49,065 --> 00:19:50,545
Only good-looking.
Has plenty of followers.

296
00:19:50,625 --> 00:19:52,665
I don't understand
why women are so obsessed with him!

297
