AI, the person I accidentally cursed
won't let me be his roommate.

315
00:21:35,825 --> 00:21:36,785
What should I do?

316
00:21:37,505 --> 00:21:38,905
<i>Don't give up yet.</i>

317
00:21:38,985 --> 00:21:40,865
<i>There's even this saying.</i>

318
00:21:40,945 --> 00:21:43,665
<i>"Dripping water</i>
<i>can eventually wear away the stone."</i>

319
00:21:43,745 --> 00:21:46,025
<i>Try to keep persuading him.</i>

320
00:21:46,105 --> 00:21:48,905
But I think this stone
is about to block me.

321
00:21:49,505 --> 00:21:52,865
<i>A stone can definitely block you,</i>
<i>and it can unblock you too.</i>

322
00:21:52,945 --> 00:21:54,385
<i>Keep trying.</i>

323
00:21:56,425 --> 00:21:58,785
But I called him, and he didn't answer.

324
00:21:58,865 --> 00:22:00,665
I can't contact him at all.

325
00:22:01,665 --> 00:22:04,305
<i>If you can't reach him</i>
<i>through a communication device,</i>

326
00:22:04,385 --> 00:22:06,585
<i>then go and see him yourself.</i>

327
00:22:10,545 --> 00:22:11,385
Hey!

328
00:22:11,905 --> 00:22:12,905
Hey!

329
00:22:15,785 --> 00:22:16,625
Hey!

330
