Ever since you joined,
we haven't won a single game.

335
00:22:52,305 --> 00:22:53,625
But…

336
00:22:54,185 --> 00:22:55,545
You just broke Non's arm.

337
00:22:55,625 --> 00:22:57,345
Don't you even realize that?

338
00:22:57,425 --> 00:22:59,585
You've already brought bad luck
upon your parents.

339
00:22:59,665 --> 00:23:01,625
Are you bringing bad luck
to everyone else too?

340
00:23:02,505 --> 00:23:03,585
Damn, you're just…

341
00:23:06,625 --> 00:23:07,705
Don't follow us.

342
00:23:07,785 --> 00:23:08,785
Walk slowly, okay?

343
00:23:08,865 --> 00:23:09,705
Shit.

344
00:23:09,785 --> 00:23:11,665
-Damn it.
-Are you okay?

345
00:23:12,585 --> 00:23:14,825
<i>You jinx.</i>
<i>No wonder nobody wants you around.</i>

346
00:23:14,905 --> 00:23:18,065
<i>You're freaking unlucky.</i>
<i>I heard your parents died because of you.</i>

347
00:23:18,145 --> 00:23:19,545
<i>You're such a freaking jinx.</i>

348
00:23:20,745 --> 00:23:21,745
<i>How pathetic.</i>

349
00:23:43,745 --> 00:23:45,505
<i>Why did they have to scold you like that?</i>

350
00:23:46,105 --> 00:23:47,425
It's normal.

351
00:23:47,945 --> 00:23:49,945
I've been treated like this
since I was a kid.

352
00:23:51,905 --> 00:23:54,265
Could you somehow
try not to get used to terrible things?

353
00:24:00,945 --> 00:24:02,425
Why are you here?

354
00:24:03,185 --> 00:24:05,385
To pester me
about becoming my roommate again?

355
00:24:07,225 --> 00:24:09,185
When will you let me be your roommate?

356
00:24:14,825 --> 00:24:15,705
No way.

357
00:24:17,145 --> 00:24:18,505
What's wrong with you?

358
00:24:18,585 --> 00:24:20,425
Why won't you let me be your roommate?

359
00:24:21,825 --> 00:24:23,625
You heard what they said.

360
00:24:25,385 --> 00:24:26,785
I'm a jinx.

361
00:24:41,825 --> 00:24:42,905
You know what?

362
00:24:43,985 --> 00:24:45,945
I'm actually a very lucky person.

363
00:24:46,545 --> 00:24:50,225
My friends even nicknamed me
"the lucky charm."

364
00:24:50,305 --> 00:24:52,305
So if I live with you,

365
00:24:52,385 --> 00:24:54,905
your bad luck won't be able to affect me.

366
00:24:55,945 --> 00:24:56,785
Come on.

367
00:24:57,545 --> 00:24:59,665
Let me be your roommate.

368
00:25:07,905 --> 00:25:08,865
Let's put it this way.

369
00:25:15,465 --> 00:25:19,585
If you make one shot out of five,
I'll let you be my roommate.

370
00:25:19,665 --> 00:25:22,185
Whoa. That sounds way too easy, huh?

371
00:25:22,265 --> 00:25:23,545
You have to shoot with your eyes closed.

372
00:25:23,625 --> 00:25:24,465
Huh?

373
00:25:25,185 --> 00:25:26,985
How am I supposed to do that?

374
00:25:27,065 --> 00:25:30,185
To prove that you really are lucky.

375
00:25:30,265 --> 00:25:33,385
But if you fail,
you have to stop pestering me about this.

376
00:25:34,225 --> 00:25:35,225
Here.

377
00:25:44,665 --> 00:25:45,865
Close your eyes.

378
00:26:17,145 --> 00:26:18,625
This is your last shot.

379
00:27:02,225 --> 00:27:03,305
Just as we agreed.

380
00:27:04,065 --> 00:27:06,025
Stay out of my life after this.

381
00:27:33,145 --> 00:27:35,185
<i>Hey, jinx!</i>

382
00:27:35,785 --> 00:27:39,145
<i>I heard your parents died because of you.</i>

383
00:28:20,865 --> 00:28:22,185
YOU JINX!

384
00:28:22,265 --> 00:28:24,265
Hey, jinx!

385
00:28:24,345 --> 00:28:26,105
What's up, jinx?

386
00:28:28,985 --> 00:28:31,905
I heard your parents died because of you.

387
00:28:31,985 --> 00:28:33,625
Hey? For real?

388
00:28:33,705 --> 00:28:36,985
Damn. How pathetic.
No wonder nobody wants you around!

389
00:28:38,225 --> 00:28:39,905
You're such a freaking jinx.

390
00:28:39,985 --> 00:28:41,105
Freaking jinx!

391
00:28:41,185 --> 00:28:42,225
Let's go.

392
00:28:45,225 --> 00:28:47,505
<i>-The jinx.</i>
<i>-No wonder nobody wants you around!</i>

393
00:28:47,585 --> 00:28:50,825
<i>-You're such a freaking jinx.</i>
<i>-I heard your parents died because of you.</i>

394
00:28:50,905 --> 00:28:52,705
<i>Freaking jinx!</i>

395
00:28:53,425 --> 00:28:54,865
<i>How pathetic.</i>

396
00:29:07,025 --> 00:29:09,545
<i>Thank you so much, everyone,</i>
<i>for supporting us.</i>

397
00:29:09,625 --> 00:29:15,825
<i>You can find more information</i>
<i>about Krit's birthday party on our page.</i>

398
00:29:16,385 --> 00:29:17,905
<i>We hope to see lots of you there.</i>

399
00:29:22,785 --> 00:29:24,505
Hey, say something.

400
00:29:25,465 --> 00:29:27,745
Please come and join us.

401
00:29:28,345 --> 00:29:30,145
<i>We both worked really hard on this.</i>

402
00:29:30,225 --> 00:29:32,385
<i>We hope to see everyone there.</i>

403
00:29:32,985 --> 00:29:34,025
<i>See you soon.</i>

404
00:29:34,105 --> 00:29:35,545
<i>Bye-bye.</i>

405
00:29:35,625 --> 00:29:36,465
<i>Bye-bye.</i>

406
00:29:39,105 --> 00:29:42,545
Hey, the tickets are sold out.
I'm so excited.

407
00:29:43,145 --> 00:29:45,545
Is there anyone
you especially want to invite?

408
00:29:48,145 --> 00:29:49,505
No.

409
00:29:50,825 --> 00:29:52,465
Okay then.

410
00:29:52,545 --> 00:29:54,105
Let's head back.

411
00:29:54,185 --> 00:29:55,265
Let's go.

412
00:30:00,305 --> 00:30:01,185
Hey!

413
00:30:03,985 --> 00:30:05,105
It's still here?

414
00:30:07,385 --> 00:30:08,625
What is it?

415
00:30:08,705 --> 00:30:11,385
Here. This is the model I wanted.

416
00:30:12,745 --> 00:30:15,905
I've been saving up to buy it.
Damn, I want it so much.

417
00:30:17,065 --> 00:30:18,465
I should definitely get it.

418
00:30:20,225 --> 00:30:21,065
Let's go.

419
00:30:28,465 --> 00:30:30,145
<i>You look great, Krit.</i>

420
00:30:30,225 --> 00:30:32,065
<i>Let's go with this outfit.</i>

421
00:30:32,145 --> 00:30:33,105
Thank you.

422
00:30:36,065 --> 00:30:38,225
Ms. Prae, I think we've received
everything you sent over.

423
00:30:38,305 --> 00:30:41,505
I'll hurry and send back the first draft
along with the previous clip.

424
00:30:41,585 --> 00:30:42,985
<i>Okay.</i>

425
00:30:47,785 --> 00:30:50,905
I didn't expect being an influencer
to take this much energy.

426
00:30:51,825 --> 00:30:55,665
I thought I could just film videos
and do live streams, and that's it.

427
00:30:55,745 --> 00:30:59,545
No. There's so much more to it,
as you can see.

428
00:31:11,105 --> 00:31:13,465
Come here. I'll massage you.

429
00:31:15,025 --> 00:31:15,865
Okay.

430
00:31:23,985 --> 00:31:27,305
When you're editing the clip,
try moving around a little more.

431
00:31:37,785 --> 00:31:39,185
Can you massage me too?

432
00:31:41,065 --> 00:31:44,145
Sure. Which part?

433
00:31:52,345 --> 00:31:54,225
You should get more rest too.

434
00:32:16,505 --> 00:32:18,985
I'm sorry. I don't make kissing content.

435
00:32:21,185 --> 00:32:22,025
Well…

436
00:32:23,105 --> 00:32:23,985
I…

437
00:32:24,985 --> 00:32:26,345
Well, I'm sorry.

438
00:32:28,945 --> 00:32:32,345
Thank you so much for today.

439
00:32:33,265 --> 00:32:36,825
I'll get going then.

440
00:32:37,425 --> 00:32:38,385
Okay.

441
00:32:40,745 --> 00:32:44,705
Also, make sure you actually rest today.

442
00:32:45,305 --> 00:32:46,625
I know you're busy,

443
00:32:47,145 --> 00:32:51,185
but don't forget about my birthday party.

444
00:33:02,025 --> 00:33:03,225
Hey, Rin!

445
00:33:03,305 --> 00:33:04,145
-Ohm!
-Rin!

446
00:33:04,225 --> 00:33:05,305
-Ohm, don't!
-Rin!

447
00:33:05,385 --> 00:33:07,065
-What's with you?
-Don't!

448
00:33:07,665 --> 00:33:08,705
Look at this.

449
00:33:10,625 --> 00:33:13,105
I don't get why
they had to go all out like that.

450
00:33:20,745 --> 00:33:22,705
Hey, where are you going?

451
00:33:32,825 --> 00:33:34,065
You like it, Krit?

452
00:33:35,665 --> 00:33:36,865
Yeah.

453
00:33:36,945 --> 00:33:38,505
I've been saving up to buy it.

454
00:33:39,185 --> 00:33:40,505
Then I'll buy it for you.

455
00:33:42,385 --> 00:33:44,865
I still don't know
what to get you for your birthday.

456
00:33:49,585 --> 00:33:50,585
Thank you.

457
00:34:17,744 --> 00:34:18,865
Krit.

458
00:34:23,185 --> 00:34:25,705
Everyone's here now. Are you ready?

459
00:34:34,425 --> 00:34:35,665
I'm a little nervous.

460
00:34:37,585 --> 00:34:39,264
It's my first time
doing a fan meeting like this.

461
00:34:39,344 --> 00:34:42,705
I don't know how I should act.

462
00:34:43,385 --> 00:34:46,385
Just be yourself.

463
00:34:46,465 --> 00:34:50,505
Everyone came here because they love you
and mean well to you.

464
00:35:00,705 --> 00:35:01,625
Let's go.

465
00:35:15,265 --> 00:35:18,225
-Happy birthday, Krit!
-Happy birthday, Krit!

466
00:35:23,345 --> 00:35:25,305
I'm only here to give him the present.

467
00:35:35,705 --> 00:35:37,305
They're so cute.

468
00:35:38,225 --> 00:35:39,905
Look at their chemistry!

469
00:35:39,985 --> 00:35:41,945
They're cute.

470
00:35:42,505 --> 00:35:43,865
Oh, I'm sorry.

471
00:35:44,385 --> 00:35:45,345
Hey.

472
00:36:04,265 --> 00:36:05,385
Why are you here?

473
00:36:18,985 --> 00:36:20,225
What are you doing here, Rin?

474
00:36:20,825 --> 00:36:22,625
I'm just here to give you a present,

475
00:36:23,785 --> 00:36:24,785
like I promised.

476
00:36:26,385 --> 00:36:28,225
I don't want anything from you anymore.

477
00:36:29,825 --> 00:36:31,265
Can you stop bothering me?

478
00:36:31,345 --> 00:36:32,265
Hey, Krit.

479
00:36:34,105 --> 00:36:35,225
Please hear me out.

480
00:36:35,825 --> 00:36:37,585
This has nothing to do with anything else.

481
00:36:38,145 --> 00:36:39,945
I genuinely just wanted
to give you the present,

482
00:36:40,025 --> 00:36:42,545
so we could finally put an end to this
and have nothing left between us.

483
00:36:43,145 --> 00:36:44,545
Please take it, Krit.

484
00:36:57,185 --> 00:36:58,265
It's over.

485
00:36:59,385 --> 00:37:03,185
No matter what you do, we're already over.

486
00:37:15,385 --> 00:37:16,865
<i>Why did Rin come?</i>

487
00:37:18,865 --> 00:37:20,705
He stopped by
to give me a birthday present.

488
00:37:22,425 --> 00:37:23,785
Where is it?

489
00:37:26,305 --> 00:37:27,585
I didn't take it.

490
00:37:27,665 --> 00:37:29,145
Huh? Why?

491
00:37:30,505 --> 00:37:31,545
Well…

492
00:37:33,225 --> 00:37:35,065
If I start being nice to Rin again,

493
00:37:36,545 --> 00:37:38,185
this will never truly end.

494
00:37:43,465 --> 00:37:45,185
I'll be right back. Give me a second.

495
00:37:53,345 --> 00:37:54,385
I'm back.

496
00:37:57,665 --> 00:37:58,585
What is it?

497
00:38:05,785 --> 00:38:08,025
Here. A present from me.

498
00:38:26,025 --> 00:38:27,065
Well?

499
00:38:33,945 --> 00:38:34,985
Thank you.

500
00:38:39,945 --> 00:38:40,865
Yeah.

501
00:38:45,145 --> 00:38:46,905
I've wanted this for so long.

502
00:38:48,385 --> 00:38:49,585
You remember?

503
00:38:50,185 --> 00:38:52,505
Of course I did. So? Do you like it?

504
00:38:53,105 --> 00:38:54,145
I do.

505
00:38:55,265 --> 00:38:56,825
Happy birthday.

506
00:40:04,305 --> 00:40:05,465
<i>Hello?</i>

507
00:40:05,545 --> 00:40:06,785
Hello, Khobfa.

508
00:40:06,865 --> 00:40:07,825
What is it?

509
00:40:07,905 --> 00:40:10,145
We don't have
an elective class today, right?

510
00:40:10,225 --> 00:40:11,745
Yeah, you're right.

511
00:40:11,825 --> 00:40:14,185
Where are you now? What are you doing?
Who are you with?

512
00:40:16,985 --> 00:40:19,145
I'm alone in my room.

513
00:40:21,705 --> 00:40:23,385
I was thinking of

514
00:40:26,025 --> 00:40:27,265
hanging a plant pot here.

515
00:40:28,425 --> 00:40:29,665
Happy now?

516
00:40:29,745 --> 00:40:30,705
I'm hanging up.

517
00:40:30,785 --> 00:40:31,625
<i>Hey, wait!</i>

518
00:40:31,705 --> 00:40:32,585
RIN

519
00:40:32,665 --> 00:40:33,945
Hey…

520
00:40:34,665 --> 00:40:35,625
Jeez.

521
00:40:36,545 --> 00:40:38,505
Why do you always do such risky things?

522
00:40:43,865 --> 00:40:44,985
Rin.

523
00:40:49,545 --> 00:40:51,505
Did you come here to spite Krit again?

524
00:40:54,985 --> 00:40:56,385
What are you talking about?

525
00:40:56,985 --> 00:40:58,465
Stop pestering Krit already.

526
00:40:59,065 --> 00:41:00,185
That's right.

527
00:41:00,265 --> 00:41:01,625
What we had is over.

528
00:41:11,305 --> 00:41:13,105
It's not because I've met someone new.

529
00:41:13,185 --> 00:41:15,465
You and I just can't be together anymore.

530
00:41:19,825 --> 00:41:22,145
Having it said
straight to my face like this…

531
00:41:23,705 --> 00:41:24,905
really hurts.

532
00:41:28,585 --> 00:41:30,745
But I'm not here to pester you.

533
00:41:31,345 --> 00:41:35,825
Then why did you come here
if that's not what you were thinking?

534
00:41:38,105 --> 00:41:39,705
You've got it all wrong.

535
00:41:44,705 --> 00:41:46,545
Rin didn't come here to see you.

536
00:41:47,585 --> 00:41:49,065
He came to see me.

537
00:42:17,305 --> 00:42:19,345
Thanks for what you did earlier.

538
00:42:31,985 --> 00:42:33,345
And this is for you.

539
00:42:43,345 --> 00:42:44,985
Why do you always draw this?

540
00:42:46,785 --> 00:42:48,145
It's a four-leaf clover.

541
00:42:48,985 --> 00:42:50,265
They say that

542
00:42:50,865 --> 00:42:53,785
out of ten thousand clover leaves,
only one will have four leaves.

543
00:42:54,385 --> 00:42:56,625
That's why it represents good luck.

544
00:42:56,705 --> 00:42:59,905
So I wanted to draw it
for someone I wanted to have good luck.

545
00:43:18,745 --> 00:43:20,425
And this is your handkerchief.

546
00:43:24,545 --> 00:43:27,945
My idea helps people play.

547
00:43:30,145 --> 00:43:31,425
People play?

548
00:43:35,025 --> 00:43:36,425
I'd rather go with "simple."

549
00:43:38,785 --> 00:43:41,385
<i>Anyone who hasn't come</i>
<i>to Krit's birthday party yet,</i>

550
00:43:41,465 --> 00:43:43,225
<i>there's still time to join us.</i>

551
00:44:00,345 --> 00:44:02,105
I'm really grateful.

552
00:44:02,825 --> 00:44:04,985
I'm sorry for disturbing you.

553
00:44:05,585 --> 00:44:08,065
But from now on,
I won't bother you anymore.

554
00:44:16,025 --> 00:44:17,145
Wait.

555
00:44:23,105 --> 00:44:26,705
Let's say this clover brings you luck.

556
00:44:28,225 --> 00:44:29,065
What?

557
00:44:33,705 --> 00:44:35,305
I'll give you one more chance

558
00:44:36,225 --> 00:44:38,185
to shoot the basketball
with your eyes closed.

559
00:44:40,385 --> 00:44:42,145
If you make the shot,

560
00:44:43,345 --> 00:44:45,505
I'll let you be my roommate.

561
00:44:48,185 --> 00:44:49,545
You said it.

562
00:45:04,545 --> 00:45:06,545
How can you make the shot
holding the ball like this?

563
00:45:25,105 --> 00:45:26,385
Close your eyes.

564
00:45:52,425 --> 00:45:53,265
Hey.

565
00:45:54,985 --> 00:45:55,825
Did it go in?

566
00:46:00,665 --> 00:46:01,865
It did.

567
00:46:02,705 --> 00:46:03,665
Seriously?

568
00:46:04,425 --> 00:46:07,105
Yes! Awesome!

569
00:46:14,745 --> 00:46:16,145
Yo, my roommate!

570
00:46:18,865 --> 00:46:20,945
But you have to promise me something.

571
00:46:21,625 --> 00:46:23,665
If anything unlucky happens,

572
00:46:23,745 --> 00:46:25,745
you have to move out right away.

573
00:46:26,345 --> 00:46:27,265
Okay.

574
00:46:31,025 --> 00:46:31,985
-Deal!
-Deal!

575
00:46:34,225 --> 00:46:36,025
Then I'll go home
and pack my things today.

576
00:46:36,105 --> 00:46:37,225
I'll move in tomorrow.

577
00:46:39,785 --> 00:46:41,385
Hey, here you are.

578
00:46:57,825 --> 00:46:59,065
<i>Did it go in?</i>

579
00:47:35,505 --> 00:47:36,825
Whatever happens, happens.

580
00:47:37,345 --> 00:47:40,625
Finally having a roommate
might actually be nice.

581
00:47:43,985 --> 00:47:44,945
Right?

582
00:47:56,585 --> 00:47:57,785
SEARCH PEOPLE

583
00:47:57,865 --> 00:47:59,065
FOLLOW REQUESTS

584
00:48:02,225 --> 00:48:03,705
FOLLOW BACK

585
00:48:07,985 --> 00:48:09,905
FOLLOWING

586
00:48:19,585 --> 00:48:22,625
<i>You usually prefer being alone. Why did</i>
<i>you agree to let Rin be your roommate?</i>

587
00:48:22,705 --> 00:48:25,945
<i>You said things between you were over,</i>
<i>so make sure they really are.</i>

588
00:48:26,025 --> 00:48:27,865
What about you? Do you like Rin?

589
00:48:29,265 --> 00:48:30,465
<i>Whenever you're with me,</i>

590
00:48:30,545 --> 00:48:32,425
<i>all the unlucky things that happen</i>
<i>seem so small.</i>

591
00:48:32,505 --> 00:48:33,985
<i>I really mean that.</i>

592
00:48:34,065 --> 00:48:35,745
<i>You can stand on your own now.</i>

593
00:48:35,825 --> 00:48:38,385
<i>Show Rin that you can do</i>
<i>just fine without him.</i>

594
00:48:38,465 --> 00:48:41,705
<i>Just wait and see whether Krit or Khobfa</i>
<i>will be the one who wins.</i>

595
00:48:41,785 --> 00:48:44,345
<i>I'll do my best.</i>
<i>I promise I won't let you down.</i>

596
00:48:44,425 --> 00:48:45,545
<i>Good luck.</i>

